			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750220801,
					"content": "Rawr! Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220802,
					"content": "Hehe, well done! Now let's see what goodies are hiding in the chest!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220803,
					"content": "Ah? There's nothing at all? Just a note?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220804,
					"content": "Oh, so the one who left the note was its actual master? So we weren't tricked by the Saurian, but by its master?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220805,
						750220808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220805,
					"content": "Totally irresponsible.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220806
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750220806,
					"content": "Yeah! Even if he was really sick, how could he just leave his Yumkasaur in a place like this!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220807,
					"content": "And he even wanted to use people's greed to... No, wait, he wanted to take advantage of people's empathy for the Saurian...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220810,
					"content": "*sigh* Anyway, it's not like we can just let it stay here tricking people out of their food. Let's go find the Chief of the Scions of the Canopy and tell him about this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220811,
					"content": "You explain the situation to Wayna, chief of the Scions of the Canopy, and bring him over.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220812
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750220812,
					"content": "Oh dear, I had a hunch about this when you came looking for me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wayna"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220813,
					"content": "Who'd have thought it was that scoundrel that left behind this creature...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wayna"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220814,
					"content": "That scoundrel?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220815
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750220815,
					"content": "Rrrawr?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220816,
					"content": "He was one who did wrong, then in fear of punishment, left the tribe of his own accord.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wayna"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220817,
					"content": "But I see no good in divulging the offender's name. Perhaps he himself was well aware that what he did was no good thing. See — he didn't even leave his name at the end of this letter.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wayna"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220818,
					"content": "So his Saurian chose to join him...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750220819,
					"content": "No, we cannot say that it \"chose\" to do so. Saurians are simple creatures that cannot easily distinguish right from wrong. Most of the time, they simply follow their emotions and trust their companions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wayna"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220820,
					"content": "...As I suspected, at the core, he hasn't changed. Whatever small wits he has he employs towards devising tricks to deceive others, even his own Saurian.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wayna"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220821,
					"content": "We will send people to feed this Yumkasaurus on a regular basis. It is a child of the tribe, after all...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wayna"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220822,
					"content": "As for that scoundrel... *sigh* It is a tragic ending indeed, but I refuse to sympathize with him. People should be held responsible for their actions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Wayna"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220808,
					"content": "So, those who eat too much are destined to be abandoned by their friends...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220809
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750220809,
					"content": "Hey! Don't even joke about things like that! Besides, the Saurian is innocent in all this, maybe it's just waiting here for its master to return, which is why it refuses to move...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
